          "review_state": "unreviewed"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "sme_spo2",
          "text": "Clip the oximeter on a finger, hand warm, relaxed and still, until it shows one steady number. A normal number does not cancel serious symptoms. The level that needs action: to be set by clinical review.",
